{"format_version":1,"id":"18d53aba5f0959573f20af9ffc3b42768bfdc2296931de43","commits":["3f0b1ebc09c43da24579738ba948a3063827cc9d"],"user_facing":true,"description":"**The project describes itself consistently on PyPI, npm and in its README.** The repository description advertised an \"inline\" terminal client while the package metadata said \"fullscreen\"; fullscreen is the true one, since the REPL runs on the alternate screen.","type":"fix"}
